Hi All. What's the alternative for use of "equals" in Nimble if I have a vector as input:
This is the piece of code:

for (i in 1:M){
    Nind[i] <- sum(z[i,1:T])
    Nalive[i] <- 1-equals(Nind[i], 0)
  } #i

Regards,
Jose

