I’m not sure what happened with the google group(s).

We’re not in control of today’s webinar enrollment, and ASA appears to have closed it as of yesterday (possibly earlier).  Sorry.

At this moment, we don’t have plans in place for another one, but it is something we may do more of.

This summer we’re giving half-day workshops/short courses at ISEC (International Statistical Ecology Conference) and ISBA (International Society for Bayesian Analysis).

